#. examBanks.readiness.title
#: src/data/exam.js:9
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.title"
msgid "Gensokyo Common Readiness"
msgstr "幻想郷共通基礎"

#. examBanks.readiness.subtitle
#: src/data/exam.js:10
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.subtitle"
msgid ""
"Campus judgment for every applicant: method, courtesy, and keeping a clear "
"head when things get strange."
msgstr "全志願者向けの判断試験。方法、礼節、奇妙な状況で平静を保つ力を問います。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.category
#: src/data/exam.js:13
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.category"
msgid "Motto"
msgstr "校訓"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:14
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.prompt"
msgid "Which action best follows “Cross borders for truth; contest ideas with respect”?"
msgstr "「境を越えて真を求め、礼をもって競う」に最も近い行動は？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:22
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.explanation"
msgid ""
"Truth-seeking crosses existing viewpoints; respectful contest requires "
"traceable rules, consent, and stopping conditions."
msgstr "真を求めるには既存の視点を越え、「礼をもって競う」には規則・同意・停止条件が必要です。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.category
#: src/data/exam.js:25
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.category"
msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:26
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.prompt"
msgid "The red lamp suddenly lights in Seven-Day Laboratory. What should you do first?"
msgstr "七曜実験塔で赤灯が点いた。最初にすることは？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:34
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.explanation"
msgid "Red-lamp evacuation is counter-clockwise; the duty practitioner identifies the element."
msgstr "赤灯時の避難は反時計回り。元素の確認は当直術者が行います。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.category
#: src/data/exam.js:37
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.category"
msgid "Source Judgment"
msgstr "情報判断"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:38
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.prompt"
msgid ""
"You hear that every campus gate will lead to the Lunar Capital tomorrow. "
"What is the best first step?"
msgstr "「明日は全校門が月都へ通じる」と聞いた。最初の一手は？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:46
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.explanation"
msgid ""
"Separate witness, hearsay, and inference, then consult traceable sources. "
"Strangeness proves neither truth nor falsehood."
msgstr "目撃・伝聞・推測を分け、追跡できる情報源を確認します。奇妙さは真偽の証明になりません。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.category
#: src/data/exam.js:49
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.category"
msgid "Shared Life"
msgstr "共同生活"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:50
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.prompt"
msgid ""
"A fairy roommate hides your alarm clock in a flowerpot as “spatial "
"beautification.” What is the best response?"
msgstr "妖精の同室者が目覚まし時計を植木鉢へ隠し「空間美化」と言った。最善の対応は？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:58
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.explanation"
msgid "Shared life needs repeatable boundaries, not retaliation or blanket prohibition."
msgstr "共同生活では、報復や全面禁止ではなく、繰り返し守れる境界を作ります。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.category
#: src/data/exam.js:61
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.category"
msgid "Research Ethics"
msgstr "研究倫理"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:62
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.prompt"
msgid ""
"A mind reader wants to use hallway thoughts as class samples. What is the "
"minimum requirement?"
msgstr "読心能力者が廊下の学生の思考を授業標本にしたい。最低限必要なのは？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:70
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.explanation"
msgid ""
"Public space does not waive inner privacy, and de-identification cannot "
"replace prior consent and withdrawal."
msgstr "公共空間でも内面のプライバシーは失われず、匿名化は事前同意と撤回手続の代わりになりません。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.category
#: src/data/exam.js:73
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.category"
msgid "Transit"
msgstr "交通"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:74
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.prompt"
msgid "After receiving a Hakurei Gate arrival time, what should an Outside World student do?"
msgstr "外界新入生が博麗門の到着時刻を受け取った後、どうする？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:82
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.explanation"
msgid ""
"Barrier passage follows the notice; unknown gaps, umbrellas, and butterflies "
"are not admissions desks."
msgstr "結界通行は通知どおりに行い、未知の隙間・傘・蝶は受付窓口ではありません。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.category
#: src/data/exam.js:85
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.category"
msgid "Spell-card Rules"
msgstr "スペルカード規則"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:86
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.prompt"
msgid "What does not determine admission in an academic spell-card interview?"
msgstr "学術スペルカード面接で合否を決めないものは？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:94
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.explanation"
msgid ""
"The interview assesses questions, methods, limits, and judgment; firepower "
"is not an academic argument."
msgstr "面接は問い・方法・制限・判断を評価し、火力の大きさは学術的論証ではありません。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.category
#: src/data/exam.js:97
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.category"
msgid "Library"
msgstr "図書館"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:98
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.prompt"
msgid ""
"A book flies away from its shelf in Misty Lake Library. What is the most "
"reasonable response?"
msgstr "霧の湖図書館で本が自力で棚を離れた。最も適切なのは？"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:106
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.explanation"
msgid ""
"The collection may fly, but call numbers do not; traceable records beat "
"chasing or damaging it."
msgstr "蔵書は飛んでも請求記号は飛びません。追跡可能な記録が追走や破壊より有効です。"

#. examBanks.boundary.title
#: src/data/exam.js:115
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.title"
msgid "Boundaries & Incident Judgment"
msgstr "境界・異変判断"

#. examBanks.boundary.subtitle
#: src/data/exam.js:116
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.subtitle"
msgid "For applicants who want to turn “not again” into a testable question."
msgstr "「また起きた」を検証可能な問いへ変えたい人のための試験。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.category
#: src/data/exam.js:119
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.category"
msgid "Incident Triage"
msgstr "異変分類"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:120
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.prompt"
msgid ""
"Every shadow begins moving three seconds late, with no injuries. What "
"matters most in the first record?"
msgstr "朝から全ての影が本人より三秒遅れるが負傷者はいない。最初の記録で最重要なのは？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:128
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.explanation"
msgid ""
"Initial records fix observable conditions before names or guesses are "
"mistaken for mechanisms."
msgstr "初期記録は観察条件を固定し、命名や推測を機構と取り違えないようにします。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.category
#: src/data/exam.js:131
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.category"
msgid "Boundary Survey"
msgstr "境界測量"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:132
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.prompt"
msgid "A signpost points differently on the second passage. Which comparison is most useful?"
msgstr "同じ道標が二度目には別方向を示した。最も価値ある比較は？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:140
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.explanation"
msgid ""
"Boundary effects often depend on sequence and viewpoint; paired records "
"distinguish a changed sign from a changed route."
msgstr "境界現象は順序と観測位置に依存しやすく、対の記録で道標と経路の変化を区別できます。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.category
#: src/data/exam.js:143
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.category"
msgid "Stopping Rules"
msgstr "停止条件"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:144
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.prompt"
msgid "Which stopping condition is most operational during incident tracking?"
msgstr "異変追跡で最も運用可能な停止条件は？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:152
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.explanation"
msgid ""
"Good stopping rules are pre-agreed, observable on site, and triggerable by "
"affected participants."
msgstr "良い停止条件は事前合意でき、現場で判定でき、影響を受ける者が起動できます。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.category
#: src/data/exam.js:155
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.category"
msgid "Drift Objects"
msgstr "漂流物"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:156
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.prompt"
msgid ""
"An Outside World object changes use after crossing the barrier. What should "
"researchers most avoid?"
msgstr "外界の物が結界通過後に用途を変えた。研究者が最も避けるべきことは？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:164
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.explanation"
msgid ""
"Sample size does not outrank barrier safety; the registry is non-invasive "
"and never widens gaps."
msgstr "標本数は境界安全に優先せず、本学の索引は裂け目を広げない非侵襲登録を原則とします。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.category
#: src/data/exam.js:167
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.category"
msgid "Oral Defence"
msgstr "口頭試問"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:168
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.prompt"
msgid "What does a “way out” mainly mean in a spell-card defence?"
msgstr "スペルカード式討論の「退路」とは主に何か？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:176
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.explanation"
msgid ""
"A way out is part of the rules, preventing pride or firepower from "
"escalating the contest indefinitely."
msgstr "退路は規則の一部で、面子や火力による無限の激化を防ぎます。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.category
#: src/data/exam.js:179
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.category"
msgid "Causality"
msgstr "因果"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:180
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.prompt"
msgid ""
"Books in the library's north wing move more often at every full moon. What "
"does this directly establish?"
msgstr "満月ごとに図書館北翼の本がよく動く。直接証明できるのは？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:188
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.explanation"
msgid ""
"Repeated association merits study, but lunar phase is not yet a cause "
"without controls and mechanism evidence."
msgstr "反復する関連は研究価値がありますが、対照と機構の証拠なしに月相を原因とは断定できません。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.category
#: src/data/exam.js:191
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.category"
msgid "Witness Records"
msgstr "目撃記録"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:192
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.prompt"
msgid "Three witnesses disagree about a danmaku's color. What is the best treatment?"
msgstr "三人の目撃者が弾幕の色について異なる証言をした。最善の処理は？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:200
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.explanation"
msgid ""
"Disagreement may be error or reveal viewpoint and sensory differences; "
"preserve context before judging."
msgstr "不一致は誤差かもしれず、観測位置や感覚差を示す可能性もあります。文脈を保存します。"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.category
#: src/data/exam.js:203
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.category"
msgid "Risk Communication"
msgstr "リスク伝達"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:204
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.prompt"
msgid ""
"A temporary low-risk inversion zone appears in a known area. What should the "
"notice include?"
msgstr "低危険で範囲既知の一時的反転区域が出現した。告知に必要なのは？"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:212
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.explanation"
msgid "Risk notices must support action and make uncertainty and the next update explicit."
msgstr "リスク告知は行動可能で、不確実性と次回更新を明示する必要があります。"

#. examBanks.methods.title
#: src/data/exam.js:221
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.title"
msgid "Research Methods & Field Records"
msgstr "研究方法・フィールド記録"

#. examBanks.methods.subtitle
#: src/data/exam.js:222
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.subtitle"
msgid ""
"Strange answers are welcome; missing methods, runaway samples, and invisible "
"corrections are not."
msgstr "奇妙な答えより、方法の未記載・逃げる標本・見つからない訂正を恐れます。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.0.category
#: src/data/exam.js:225
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.0.category"
msgid "Operational Definition"
msgstr "操作的定義"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.0.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:226
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.0.prompt"
msgid "When studying “thick mist,” which definition is most comparable?"
msgstr "「霧が濃い」を研究する際、比較に最適な定義は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.0.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:234
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.0.explanation"
msgid "An operational definition converts a feeling into repeatable measurement conditions."
msgstr "操作的定義は感覚を再現可能な測定条件へ変え、観察者間の比較を可能にします。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.1.category
#: src/data/exam.js:237
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.1.category"
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "対照"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.1.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:238
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.1.prompt"
msgid "When testing whether a kappa turbine needs no magic, what is the most important control?"
msgstr "河童水車が妖力不要か試す際、最重要な対照は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.1.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:246
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.1.explanation"
msgid ""
"Testing magic independence requires matched water and load plus real "
"isolation of magical input."
msgstr "妖力依存を検証するには、水位と負荷を揃え、妖力入力を実際に隔離します。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.2.category
#: src/data/exam.js:249
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.2.category"
msgid "Sampling"
msgstr "標本"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.2.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:250
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.2.prompt"
msgid ""
"If you interview only people who escaped the Bamboo Forest, what are you "
"most likely to miss?"
msgstr "竹林から出られた人だけに聞くと、何を見落とす？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.2.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:258
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.2.explanation"
msgid ""
"This is survivorship bias: successful exits overstate working methods and "
"hide failure paths."
msgstr "典型的な生存者バイアスで、成功法を過大評価し失敗経路を見落とします。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.3.category
#: src/data/exam.js:261
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.3.category"
msgid "Reproducibility"
msgstr "再現性"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.3.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:262
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.3.prompt"
msgid "Which magic experiment record is easiest to reproduce?"
msgstr "最も再現しやすい魔法実験記録は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.3.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:270
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.3.explanation"
msgid ""
"Reproducible records include success, failure, sequence, and environment "
"instead of relying on tacit memory."
msgstr "再現可能な記録は成功・失敗・操作順序・環境条件を含み、個人の暗黙記憶に頼りません。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.4.category
#: src/data/exam.js:273
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.4.category"
msgid "Corrections"
msgstr "データ訂正"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.4.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:274
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.4.prompt"
msgid ""
"After publication, 12 dates are found to be transcribed incorrectly. What is "
"the best response?"
msgstr "研究公開後、日付12件の転記ミスが判明した。最善の対応は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.4.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:282
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.4.explanation"
msgid ""
"A correction is itself a research record: what changed, why, and which "
"conclusions are affected."
msgstr "訂正も研究記録です。何をなぜ変え、どの結論に影響するかを示します。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.5.category
#: src/data/exam.js:285
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.5.category"
msgid "Image Ethics"
msgstr "画像倫理"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.5.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:286
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.5.prompt"
msgid "An interviewee later withdraws consent to publish a photograph. What should the team do?"
msgstr "取材相手が後から写真公開の同意を撤回した。研究班は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.5.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:294
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.5.explanation"
msgid ""
"Withdrawal must be actionable and limits on recall explained; one-time "
"consent is not permanent."
msgstr "撤回手続は実行可能で、回収不能な範囲も説明します。一度の同意は永久ではありません。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.6.category
#: src/data/exam.js:297
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.6.category"
msgid "Inference"
msgstr "推論"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.6.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:298
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.6.prompt"
msgid ""
"Electrical leakage appeared during rain in all three observations. What is a "
"reasonable next step?"
msgstr "三回とも雨天に漏電した。合理的な次の手順は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.6.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:306
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.6.explanation"
msgid ""
"The pattern suggests a hypothesis; next isolate related factors and add "
"controls that distinguish mechanisms."
msgstr "初期パターンは仮説を与えます。次は関連因子を分離し、機構を区別する対照を増やします。"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.7.category
#: src/data/exam.js:309
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.7.category"
msgid "Field Notes"
msgstr "フィールドノート"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.7.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:310
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.7.prompt"
msgid "Which line most resembles a sound field note?"
msgstr "合格するフィールドノートに最も近い一文は？"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.7.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:318
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.7.explanation"
msgid ""
"Time, place, sensory source, counter-observation, and environment are "
"separated so the observation can be reconstructed."
msgstr "時刻・位置・感覚源・反例・環境条件が分けて記され、観察を再構成できます。"

#. examBanks.campus.title
#: src/data/exam.js:327
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.title"
msgid "Campus Life Practicum"
msgstr "キャンパス生活実務"

#. examBanks.campus.subtitle
#: src/data/exam.js:328
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.subtitle"
msgid "From flight levels to dining queues: making it through a term is a method too."
msgstr "飛行レイヤーから食堂の列まで。無事に一学期を過ごすことも方法論です。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.0.category
#: src/data/exam.js:331
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.0.category"
msgid "Map"
msgstr "地図"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.0.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:332
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.0.prompt"
msgid "Which campus place takes the longest walk from Hakurei Gate?"
msgstr "博麗門から徒歩で最も時間がかかる施設は？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.0.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:340
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.0.explanation"
msgid "Kappa Joint Workshop is in the mountain field zone, about 31 minutes from the gate."
msgstr "河童共同工房は妖怪の山実習区にあり、正門から徒歩約31分です。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.1.category
#: src/data/exam.js:343
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.1.category"
msgid "Air Route"
msgstr "空路"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.1.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:344
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.1.prompt"
msgid "What is the air-route rule above Eientei Clinic?"
msgstr "永遠亭診療所上空の原則は？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.1.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:352
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.1.explanation"
msgid "Emergency rabbit carts and medical transport have priority; sightseeing traffic yields."
msgstr "救急兎車と医療輸送が優先され、観光飛行は譲ります。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.2.category
#: src/data/exam.js:355
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.2.category"
msgid "Clubs"
msgstr "団体"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.2.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:356
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.2.prompt"
msgid "Which club best suits practicing navigation when the return route may change?"
msgstr "帰路が変わるかもしれない道での案内を練習したい。最適な団体は？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.2.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:364
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.2.explanation"
msgid ""
"Bamboo Navigation documents unstable routes, return markers, and companion "
"rules for getting lost."
msgstr "竹林オリエンテーリング部は不安定経路、帰還標識、迷った際の同行規則を扱います。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.3.category
#: src/data/exam.js:367
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.3.category"
msgid "Dining"
msgstr "食堂"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.3.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:368
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.3.prompt"
msgid "When is Night-Sparrow Supper normally available?"
msgstr "夜雀夜食は通常何時から？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.3.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:376
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.3.explanation"
msgid "Night-Sparrow Supper follows evening performances and is served after 17:30."
msgstr "夜雀夜食は夜の演奏に合わせ、17:30以降に提供されます。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.4.category
#: src/data/exam.js:379
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.4.category"
msgid "Festival"
msgstr "大学祭"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.4.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:380
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.4.prompt"
msgid "What is the basic venue rule for the Spring Spell-card Lantern Festival?"
msgstr "春季スペルカード灯会の基本会場規則は？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.4.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:388
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.4.explanation"
msgid ""
"Separating sky and ground preserves safe distance for viewing, dining, and "
"spell-card displays."
msgstr "空と地上を分け、観覧・飲食・スペルカード展示の安全距離を保ちます。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.5.category
#: src/data/exam.js:391
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.5.category"
msgid "Borrowing"
msgstr "貸出"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.5.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:392
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.5.prompt"
msgid "What may and may not be borrowed from Kappa Joint Workshop?"
msgstr "河童共同工房で借りられる物・借りられない物は？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.5.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:400
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.5.explanation"
msgid ""
"Mountain rain gear may be borrowed; unfinished prototypes remain in the "
"workshop for records and testing."
msgstr "山地用雨具は貸出可。未完成の試作機は記録・試験のため工房に残します。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.6.category
#: src/data/exam.js:403
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.6.category"
msgid "BBS"
msgstr "BBS"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.6.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:404
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.6.prompt"
msgid "You have unverified breaking news. What best follows Campus BBS rules?"
msgstr "未確認の速報がある。学内BBS規則に最も合う行動は？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.6.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:412
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.6.explanation"
msgid ""
"The BBS is for deliberation; Journalism verifies breaking news, while posts "
"distinguish witness, hearsay, and inference."
msgstr "BBSは熟議向け。速報は新聞学部で確認し、投稿では目撃・伝聞・推測を分けます。"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.7.category
#: src/data/exam.js:415
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.7.category"
msgid "Exams"
msgstr "試験"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.7.prompt
#: src/data/exam.js:416
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.7.prompt"
msgid "Besides examination time, what should a flying candidate allow for at Boundary Hall?"
msgstr "飛行受験者が境界講堂へ行く際、試験時刻以外に何を見込む？"

#. examBanks.campus.questions.7.explanation
#: src/data/exam.js:424
msgctxt "text:examBanks.campus.questions.7.explanation"
msgid ""
"Boundary Hall roof berths are limited, so landing and registration time "
"belong in the plan."
msgstr "境界講堂の屋上停泊枠は有限で、着陸・登録時間を見込みます。"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:16
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.0"
msgid "Duel first; the winner defines the facts"
msgstr "まず決闘し、勝者が事実を決める"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:17
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.1"
msgid "Cross to gather evidence while preserving consent, rules, and a way out"
msgstr "境を越えて証拠を集め、同意・規則・退路も残す"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:18
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.2"
msgid "Avoid conflict by studying only what you already believe"
msgstr "衝突を避け、信じていることだけを研究する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:19
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.0.options.3"
msgid "Leave every conclusion to the oldest person"
msgstr "すべての結論を最年長者に委ねる"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:28
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.0"
msgid "Evacuate counter-clockwise along the marked route"
msgstr "標線に沿って反時計回りに退避する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:29
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.1"
msgid "Move closer to identify the element"
msgstr "近づいて元素を確認する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:30
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.2"
msgid "Open a window to vent the magic"
msgstr "窓を開けて魔力を逃がす"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:31
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.1.options.3"
msgid "Photograph it for the BBS first"
msgstr "まず写真をBBSへ投稿する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:40
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.0"
msgid "Forward it immediately with three exclamation marks"
msgstr "すぐに感嘆符三つで拡散する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:41
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.1"
msgid "Ask whether it was witnessed, then check campus and barrier notices"
msgstr "伝聞か目撃かを確認し、学務・結界観測の告知を調べる"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:42
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.2"
msgid "Ignore it because it sounds impossible"
msgstr "不可能なので完全に無視する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:43
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.2.options.3"
msgid "Walk through every gate once"
msgstr "全ての門を一度ずつ通る"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:52
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.0"
msgid "Hide the fairy in a flowerpot"
msgstr "相手も植木鉢へ隠す"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:53
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.1"
msgid "Quietly buy ten louder alarms"
msgstr "もっと大音量の時計を十個買う"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:54
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.2"
msgid "Explain property boundaries and agree on play areas and return times"
msgstr "物の境界を説明し、遊んでよい範囲と返却時間を決める"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:55
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.3.options.3"
msgid "Declare the whole residence flower-free"
msgstr "寮全体を花禁止区域にする"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:64
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.0"
msgid "No consent is needed in a public corridor"
msgstr "公共廊下なので同意不要"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:65
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.1"
msgid "Removing names is enough"
msgstr "名前を書かなければよい"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:66
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.2"
msgid "Explicit consent, a withdrawal path, and a stated use under course rules"
msgstr "授業規程に基づく明確な同意、撤回方法、利用目的の説明"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:67
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.4.options.3"
msgid "A verbal nod from the instructor"
msgstr "担当教員の口頭承認"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:76
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.0"
msgid "Find a gap and enter three days early"
msgstr "自分で隙間を探し、三日前に入る"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:77
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.1"
msgid "Wait at the specified entrance and time, registering Outside World electronics"
msgstr "指定入口・時刻に案内を待ち、外界の電気製品を登録する"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:78
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.2"
msgid "Follow the first butterfly that looks confident"
msgstr "道に詳しそうな蝶について行く"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:79
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.5.options.3"
msgid "Swim into campus through Misty Lake"
msgstr "霧の湖から泳いで入る"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:88
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.0"
msgid "Clarity of rules"
msgstr "規則の明確さ"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:89
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.1"
msgid "Ability to explain one's method"
msgstr "自分の方法を説明できるか"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:90
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.2"
msgid "Raw firepower"
msgstr "純粋な火力"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:91
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.6.options.3"
msgid "Knowing when to stop"
msgstr "いつ止めるべきかの判断"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:100
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.0"
msgid "Chase it while shouting the entire text"
msgstr "追いかけて全文を叫ぶ"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:101
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.1"
msgid "Note the call number and direction, then alert the north-wing librarian"
msgstr "請求記号と方向を記録し、北翼の司書へ知らせる"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:102
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.2"
msgid "Mark it automatically returned"
msgstr "自動返却されたことにする"

#. examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:103
msgctxt "text:examBanks.readiness.questions.7.options.3"
msgid "Shoot it down with a fireball"
msgstr "火球で撃ち落とす"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:122
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.0"
msgid "Give the incident the scariest possible name"
msgstr "最も恐ろしい異変名をつける"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:123
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.1"
msgid "Time, range, exceptions, light source, and reproducibility"
msgstr "時刻・範囲・例外・光源・再現条件"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:124
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.2"
msgid "The presumed culprit's clothing color"
msgstr "推定犯人の服の色"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:125
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.0.options.3"
msgid "Declare the shadows sentient"
msgstr "影に自我があると宣言する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:134
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.0"
msgid "Compare only which photo looks better"
msgstr "写真の美しさだけを比べる"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:135
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.1"
msgid "Record crossing order, lunar phase, companions, and observation position"
msgstr "通過順序・月相・同行者・観測位置を記録する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:136
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.2"
msgid "Remove the signpost so the problem disappears"
msgstr "道標を抜けば問題は消える"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:137
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.1.options.3"
msgid "Ask the signpost which direction it prefers"
msgstr "道標に好きな方向を聞く"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:146
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.0"
msgid "When the researcher gets a bad feeling"
msgstr "研究員が嫌な感じを覚えた時"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:147
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.1"
msgid "Three consecutive safety-limit readings or any companion withdrawing consent"
msgstr "観測値が三回連続で安全線を超える、または同行者が同意を撤回する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:148
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.2"
msgid "When everyone gets tired"
msgstr "全員が疲れるまで"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:149
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.2.options.3"
msgid "When the incident says you may stop"
msgstr "異変が止めてよいと言う"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:158
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.0"
msgid "Record original use, present use, and the owner's account"
msgstr "元の用途・現在の用途・所有者の説明を記録する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:159
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.1"
msgid "Widen an unknown gap to obtain more samples"
msgstr "標本を増やすため未知の裂け目を広げる"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:160
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.2"
msgid "Use non-invasive registration"
msgstr "非侵襲的な登録を使う"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:161
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.3.options.3"
msgid "Record observation separately from interpretation"
msgstr "観察と解釈を分けて記録する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:170
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.0"
msgid "The loser may pretend not to have attended"
msgstr "敗者が参加していないふりをする"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:171
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.1"
msgid "Published stopping conditions and a safe exit procedure"
msgstr "事前公開された終了条件と安全な退出方法"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:172
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.2"
msgid "The lecture hall's back door is unlocked"
msgstr "講堂の裏口が開いていること"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:173
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.4.options.3"
msgid "Changing the question when stuck"
msgstr "答えられなければ問題を変える"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:182
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.0"
msgid "The moon commands the books to move"
msgstr "月が本に移動を命じている"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:183
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.1"
msgid "An observed association; the mechanism still needs controls"
msgstr "満月と移動頻度が観測上関連し、機構は要検証"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:184
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.2"
msgid "Every book is a moon rabbit"
msgstr "全ての本が月兎である"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:185
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.5.options.3"
msgid "The north wing should close forever"
msgstr "北翼を永久閉鎖すべきだ"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:194
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.0"
msgid "Use the loudest witness"
msgstr "最も声の大きい証人を採用する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:195
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.1"
msgid "Preserve the differences with position, species vision, and lighting conditions"
msgstr "差異を残し、位置・種族視覚・照明条件も記録する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:196
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.2"
msgid "Average the three colors"
msgstr "三色の平均を取る"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:197
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.6.options.3"
msgid "Discard all witness data"
msgstr "全ての目撃資料を削除する"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:206
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.0"
msgid "Only “do not ask”"
msgstr "「聞くな」だけ"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:207
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.1"
msgid "Area, time, visible effects, detour, and next update"
msgstr "範囲・時間・見える現象・迂回路・更新時刻"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:208
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.2"
msgid "A suspected culprit's name"
msgstr "推定犯人の氏名"

#. examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.3
#: src/data/exam.js:209
msgctxt "text:examBanks.boundary.questions.7.options.3"
msgid "The full text of every past incident"
msgstr "過去の全異変全文"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.0.options.0
#: src/data/exam.js:228
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.0.options.0"
msgid "It looks atmospheric"
msgstr "雰囲気がある"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.0.options.1
#: src/data/exam.js:229
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.0.options.1"
msgid "Minutes a 20-metre marker is obscured under fixed lighting"
msgstr "固定照明で20m標識が見えない分数"

#. examBanks.methods.questions.0.options.2
#: src/data/exam.js:230
msgctxt "text:examBanks.methods.questions.0.options.2"
msgid "Cirno says it is thick"
msgstr "チルノが濃いと言った"

